{"id":"level-up-2026-10-12","name":"2026-10-12 每日卡片","project":"level-up-cards","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/aha-moment-art/level-up-cards/tree/5fe1e82100e36ff24691128b840751378978fb45","sentences":[{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-12:s1201","en":"We sold the redundant equipment after closing our second workshop.","zh":"关闭第二间车间后，我们卖掉了多余的设备。","note":"redundant · 被解雇的； 多余的， 过剩的； 累赘的， 冗长的 · redundant equipment","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-12:s1202","en":"The developer has a vested interest in the road project.","zh":"这家开发商在道路项目中有既得利益。","note":"vested · 法律规定的； 既定的 · vested interest","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-12:s1203","en":"We cannot reach a conclusion without examining the original records.","zh":"不检查原始记录，我们就无法得出结论。","note":"conclusion · 结论， 推论； 结束， 结尾； 【法】 缔结， 议定 · reach a conclusion","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-12:s1204","en":"These durable boots survived three winters of daily mountain walks.","zh":"这双耐穿的靴子经受住了三个冬天每天山间行走的考验。","note":"durable · 耐用的 · durable material","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-12:s1205","en":"The library may impose restrictions on borrowing particularly fragile books.","zh":"图书馆可能会限制借阅特别脆弱的书籍。","note":"impose · 把…强加于； 征； 处以 · impose restrictions","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-12:s1206","en":"The museum displays the skeleton of a large marine mammal.","zh":"博物馆展出了一具大型海洋哺乳动物的骨架。","note":"mammal · 哺乳动物 · marine mammal","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-12:s1207","en":"We wiped the condensation from the windows before taking photographs.","zh":"我们擦掉窗户上的凝结水后才拍照。","note":"condensation · 浓缩， 凝结 · condensation on windows","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-12:s1208","en":"My bank statement showed a payment I did not recognise.","zh":"我的银行对账单上有一笔我不认识的付款。","note":"statement · 陈述； 声明； 报表 · bank statement","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-12:s1209","en":"The shop offers free delivery for orders over fifty pounds.","zh":"这家商店为超过五十英镑的订单提供免费配送。","note":"delivery · 投递， 交付； 分娩 · free delivery","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-12:s1210","en":"She hoped to conquer her fear of heights through climbing.","zh":"她希望通过攀岩克服恐高。","note":"conquer · 征服， 战胜， 占领； 克服， 破除 · conquer a fear","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-12:s1211","en":"Detailed notes ensure continuity when another teacher takes the class.","zh":"详细的笔记能在另一位老师接课时确保教学的连贯性。","note":"continuity · 连续； 持续 · ensure continuity","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-12:s1212","en":"A bronze sculpture stands beside the entrance to the gallery.","zh":"美术馆入口旁矗立着一座青铜雕塑。","note":"sculpture · 雕塑品 · bronze sculpture","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-12:s1213","en":"His manipulative behaviour gradually damaged the trust within our team.","zh":"他操控他人的行为逐渐损害了团队内部的信任。","note":"manipulative · 操纵别人的； 老于世故的 · manipulative behaviour","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-12:s1214","en":"Warm candle wax dripped onto the table during dinner.","zh":"晚餐时，温热的烛蜡滴到了桌上。","note":"wax · 给…上蜡， 给…打蜡； 渐圆， 渐满；蜡；蜂蜡 · candle wax","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-12:s1215","en":"The village lost valuable arable land when the reservoir expanded.","zh":"水库扩建时，这个村庄失去了宝贵的耕地。","note":"arable · 可耕作的；耕地 · arable land","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-12:s1216","en":"The moving walkway gave me a strange sensation of floating.","zh":"自动人行道让我产生了一种奇怪的漂浮感。","note":"sensation · 感觉能力； 感觉， 知觉； 轰动， 引起轰动的事件 · a strange sensation","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-12:s1217","en":"The exhibition examines how urban development has changed local rivers.","zh":"这个展览探讨城市开发如何改变了当地河流。","note":"urban · 都市的； 住在都市的 · urban development","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-12:s1218","en":"Please refer to the diagram when assembling the wooden frame.","zh":"组装木框时，请参照这张示意图。","note":"refer · 参考， 查阅， 查询； 提到， 谈及； 引用； 提交， 上呈 · refer to","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-12:s1219","en":"We discussed the new timetable at our weekly departmental meeting.","zh":"我们在每周的部门会议上讨论了新的时间表。","note":"departmental · 部门的 · departmental meeting","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-12:s1220","en":"A small flame flickered inside the lantern beside our tent.","zh":"帐篷旁的灯笼里，一小簇火苗在闪烁。","note":"flame · 发火焰， 燃烧；火焰；强烈的感情 · a small flame","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-12:s1221","en":"The research team measured melatonin levels at different times.","zh":"研究团队测量了不同时间的褪黑激素水平。","note":"melatonin · 褪黑激素 · melatonin levels","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-12:s1222","en":"Please discard the damaged labels before packing the remaining jars.","zh":"包装剩余罐子之前，请丢弃破损的标签。","note":"discard · 丢弃， 遗弃 · discard old papers","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-12:s1223","en":"A government subsidy helped the village restore its bus service.","zh":"政府补助帮助这个村庄恢复了公交服务。","note":"subsidy · 津贴， 补助金 · government subsidy","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-12:s1224","en":"Residents accused the company of making obscene profits from housing.","zh":"居民指责这家公司通过住房牟取巨额暴利。","note":"obscene · 淫秽的， 猥亵的， 下流的； 可憎的， 可恶的； 大得惊人的， 骇人听闻的 · obscene profits","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-12:s1225","en":"The prohibitive cost of repairs forced us to replace the printer.","zh":"高得令人却步的维修费用迫使我们更换打印机。","note":"prohibitive · 禁止的， 抑制的； 令人望而却步的 · prohibitive cost","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-12:s1226","en":"An attentive listener notices when a speaker hesitates or changes tone.","zh":"专心的听众会注意到说话者的犹豫或语气变化。","note":"attentive · 注意的， 专心的； 关心的， 体贴的； 留意的 · attentive listener","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-12:s1227","en":"Her course in visual merchandising included designing attractive window displays.","zh":"她的视觉商品陈列课程包括设计吸引人的橱窗展示。","note":"merchandising · 销售规划 · visual merchandising","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-12:s1228","en":"New investment brought unexpected energy to the town's moribund industry.","zh":"新投资为小镇日渐衰落的产业带来了意想不到的活力。","note":"moribund · 垂死的， 即将灭亡的； 即将结束的 · moribund industry","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-12:s1229","en":"Use the flat side of the knife to crush garlic.","zh":"用刀的平面把大蒜压碎。","note":"crush · 碾碎； 压服， 压垮； 镇压， 制服； 压碎， 压坏 · crush garlic","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-12:s1230","en":"You can embed a short video in your online portfolio.","zh":"你可以在网上作品集中嵌入一段短视频。","note":"embed · 把…嵌入， 扎牢； 使深留脑中 · embed a video","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-12:s1231","en":"The first trial produced promising results, but further testing remains necessary.","zh":"首次试验结果很有希望，但仍需进一步测试。","note":"promising · 有希望的； 有前途的 · promising results","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-12:s1232","en":"She sought counsel from her mentor before accepting the promotion.","zh":"接受晋升前，她向导师征求了意见。","note":"counsel · 商议， 劝告；律师，法律顾问；建议，忠告 · seek counsel","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-12:s1233","en":"Students examined photographs of liver cells during the biology lesson.","zh":"学生们在生物课上观察了肝细胞的照片。","note":"liver · 生活者， 居住者； 肝脏 · liver cells","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-12:s1234","en":"Dark clouds suggested a high probability of rain that afternoon.","zh":"乌云表明那天下午很可能下雨。","note":"probability · 可能性； 概率 · high probability","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-12:s1235","en":"The kitchen has stainless steel shelves that are easy to clean.","zh":"厨房里装有易于清洁的不锈钢架子。","note":"stainless · 不锈的； 无污点的， 无瑕疵的 · stainless steel","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-12:s1236","en":"The committee debated consequential changes to the university's admissions system.","zh":"委员会讨论了大学招生制度中影响重大的变革。","note":"consequential · 结果的， 随之发生的 · consequential changes","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-12:s1237","en":"We decided to take the metro rather than drive downtown.","zh":"我们决定乘地铁去市中心，而不是开车。","note":"metro · 地下铁路 · take the metro","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-12:s1238","en":"Patience and careful planning eventually prevailed over our initial difficulties.","zh":"耐心和周密计划最终帮助我们克服了最初的困难。","note":"prevail · 流行， 盛行； 占优势， 战胜 · prevail over","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-12:s1239","en":"The empty garden offered a sense of tranquility after work.","zh":"下班后，空无一人的花园带来了一份宁静。","note":"tranquility · 宁静， 安静 · a sense of tranquility","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-12:s1240","en":"Careful measurements help us minimise waste when cutting expensive fabric.","zh":"裁剪昂贵面料时，仔细测量有助于尽量减少浪费。","note":"minimise · 使减到最低限度； 最小化 · minimise waste","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-12:s1241","en":"I like to browse the shelves before choosing a novel.","zh":"挑选小说前，我喜欢先浏览书架上的书。","note":"browse · 吃嫩叶或草；浏览；嫩叶， 嫩芽； 吃草； 浏览 · browse the shelves","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-12:s1242","en":"The council plans to intensify efforts to protect historic buildings.","zh":"市议会计划加大保护历史建筑的力度。","note":"intensify · 使增强； 使加剧 · intensify efforts","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-12:s1243","en":"She saved a small portion of the cake for her brother.","zh":"她给弟弟留了一小块蛋糕。","note":"portion · 部分；一份；划分， 分配 · a small portion","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-12:s1244","en":"We made a futile attempt to dry clothes in the rain.","zh":"我们徒劳地试图在雨中把衣服晾干。","note":"futile · 无效的， 无用的， 无意义的； 没出息的； 琐细的 · a futile attempt","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-12:s1245","en":"The storyteller managed to engross the audience for an entire hour.","zh":"这位讲故事的人成功地让观众整整一小时全神贯注。","note":"engross · 使全神贯注， 占去全部注意力和时间 · engross the audience","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-12:s1246","en":"Do not confuse the delivery date with the payment deadline.","zh":"不要把交货日期和付款截止日期混淆。","note":"confuse · 使混乱， 混淆； 使迷惑， 使糊涂 · confuse with","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-12:s1247","en":"Her business acumen helped the small bakery survive rising costs.","zh":"她敏锐的商业头脑帮助这家小面包店挺过了成本上涨。","note":"acumen · 敏锐； 精明 · business acumen","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-12:s1248","en":"The wind began to abate slightly as we approached the harbour.","zh":"我们接近港口时，风势开始略微减弱。","note":"abate · 减轻； 降价 · abate slightly","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-12:s1249","en":"The fire caused a tragic loss of irreplaceable historical documents.","zh":"火灾造成了无法替代的历史文献的惨重损失。","note":"tragic · 悲惨的； 悲剧的 · a tragic loss","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-12:s1250","en":"A local physician gave a talk at our community centre.","zh":"一位当地医生在我们的社区中心作了一场讲座。","note":"physician · 内科医生， 医师 · a local physician","recordings":[]}],"words":[{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-12:w1201","en":"redundant","zh":"被解雇的； 多余的， 过剩的； 累赘的， 冗长的","note":"英 /rɪ'dʌndənt/ · 美 /rɪ'dʌndənt/","recordings":[{"label":"词条英音","url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/aha-moment-art/level-up-cards/5fe1e82100e36ff24691128b840751378978fb45/word-audio/1201-uk-25640ec30d05.mp3","text":"redundant"},{"label":"词条美音","url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/aha-moment-art/level-up-cards/5fe1e82100e36ff24691128b840751378978fb45/word-audio/1201-us-69e387d0f9f4.mp3","text":"redundant"}]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-12:w1202","en":"vested","zh":"法律规定的； 既定的","note":"英 /'vestɪd/ · 美 /'vɛstɪd/","recordings":[{"label":"词条英音","url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/aha-moment-art/level-up-cards/5fe1e82100e36ff24691128b840751378978fb45/word-audio/1202-uk-23cc55b9e132.mp3","text":"vested"},{"label":"词条美音","url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/aha-moment-art/level-up-cards/5fe1e82100e36ff24691128b840751378978fb45/word-audio/1202-us-67a669f21f0e.mp3","text":"vested"}]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-12:w1203","en":"conclusion","zh":"结论， 推论； 结束， 结尾； 【法】 缔结， 议定","note":"英 /kən'kluːʒn/ · 美 /kən'kluʒn/","recordings":[{"label":"词条英音","url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/aha-moment-art/level-up-cards/5